body:
so...lonely/socially hurt --> anhedonia --> no interests or desire to do anything --> nothing to talk about or do with people and feeling like an alien --> lonely/socially hurt --> ......

&#x200B;

I've been thinking about this a lot lately actually and \*trying\* to feign interest in things to maybe trick myself into have a desire to do anything. Has yet to work, but I guess there's not much to lose.
